---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
---
<Base title="Acupuncture cost Wimbledon & Reading | Price & Insurance | yin yang uk" description="Curious about acupuncture cost Wimbledon or acupuncture cost Reading? View our price list for expert acupuncture, bone-setting, Tui Na, and insurance details.">
  <PageHero title="Transparent fees. No surprises." lede="General TCM consultation from £10. Acupuncture £60. All-inclusive Integrated Treatment £120. Both practitioners are recognised providers with AXA Health, Vitality, Aviva, and WPA." />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>20% off your first treatment, applied at booking. We believe you should know exactly what you're paying — and whether your insurer will cover it — before you even pick up the phone.</p>
      <div class="cards grid-3" style="margin:2rem 0">
        <article class="card"><div class="card-body"><p class="muted">General TCM Consultation</p><p class="price">£10</p><p>Initial assessment & diagnosis</p></div></article>
        <article class="card"><div class="card-body"><p class="muted">Acupuncture</p><p class="price">£60</p><p>Per treatment session</p></div></article>
        <article class="card"><div class="card-body"><p class="muted">Integrated Treatment</p><p class="price">£120</p><p>All techniques as clinically indicated</p></div></article>
      </div>
      <h2>Provider numbers</h2>
      <div class="cards cards-2">
        <article class="card"><div class="card-body">
          <h3>Winton Hui (Shing Hui)</h3>
          <p>ATCM: FM0250005 · MBAcC: 963087</p>
          <p>Vitality Health: SP123180</p>
        </div></article>
        <article class="card"><div class="card-body">
          <h3>Andrea Li (Chui Ying Li)</h3>
          <p>ATCM: FM0250004 · MBAcC: 963093</p>
          <p>Vitality Health: SP123173</p>
        </div></article>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:2rem 0;align-items:center">
        <img src="/images/axa-pgrbfCYpRRoo1New.png" alt="AXA" style="height:48px;width:auto" />
        <img src="/images/pru-health-vitalty-insurance-london-canada-water-se16-stratford-e15-e20-canary-wharf-e14-london-bridge-se1-rDAt2VDOOdmYgqEM.webp" alt="Vitality" style="height:48px;width:auto" />
        <img src="/images/wpa-sbHlIPUxP3aHSfe4.png" alt="WPA" style="height:48px;width:auto" />
      </div>
      <h2>How to claim on your insurance</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Verify your benefit — confirm acupuncture or complementary therapy is included.</li>
        <li>Get authorisation — some insurers require pre-approval and a GP referral.</li>
        <li>Book & inform us that you are claiming on insurance.</li>
        <li>Quote the provider number above when submitting your claim.</li>
        <li>Receive your itemised receipt after every session.</li>
        <li>Health cash plans (Simplyhealth, Healthshield and similar) also accepted.</li>
      </ol>
      <div class="faq">
        <details><summary>Is the £10 consultation fee separate from the treatment fee?</summary><p>Yes. The consultation covers your TCM assessment and diagnosis. If treatment follows in the same session, the relevant treatment fee applies in addition.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Does my NHS GP referral affect my insurance claim?</summary><p>Some private insurers require a GP referral before authorising complementary therapy claims. Check your policy terms — we can provide any clinical documentation your insurer requires.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Are herbal granules included in the consultation fee?</summary><p>Herbal granules are charged per day of prescription, separate from consultation and treatment fees.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What does the 20% first-visit discount apply to?</summary><p>The first-visit discount is applied at booking to your first treatment.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Do I need to inform you I'm using insurance before my appointment?</summary><p>Yes — tell us at booking so we prepare the correct documentation.</p></details>
        <details><summary>My insurer isn't listed — can I still claim?</summary><p>Often yes. We provide receipts that meet standard cash-plan and insurer submission requirements. Check with your insurer first.</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
